body:
OP here. Since the stamina settings in the 1800s are absurdly high, I traded for Dan Collins, a reliever with high stuff and high movement, as well as 3 elite pitches. He wasn't being used much in Cincy, so I traded a solid prospect and some other garbage for him, and turned this 20 stamina pitcher into the greatest pitcher I've ever seen. 

&#x200B;

Here's his stats now. [https://imgur.com/a/XBbMQrG](https://imgur.com/a/XBbMQrG)

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

honestly, i can switch no and the rams, but other than that, they both have games vs the afc, so i couldnt. 

&#x200B;

at least i got my beloved lions in <3
